  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>A plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;pass through the intersection of planes&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;can be written as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8869;</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><msub><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Since, the distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math> from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;to the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Now the distance of plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;from point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>169</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>625</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><msqrt><mn>830</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><mn>830</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>250</mn><mn>83</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
